        "The boxplot plotting failed with a ValueError because the index of the combined dataframe has duplicate labels. Although the original dataframes were reset, the concatenation might be creating duplicate index values. To address this, I will reset the index of the combined dataframe before plotting. I will also ensure the 'Location' column is added back to the original dataframes before concatenation.\n",
