        "print(\"\\n- **Temperature and Relative Humidity:** As expected, there is a strong negative correlation between air temperature and relative humidity in both locations.\")\n",
        "print(\"- **Solar Radiation and Temperature:** Solar radiation is positively correlated with both air and soil temperatures in both locations.\")\n",
        "print(\"- **Soil Temperature and Air Temperature:** Soil temperatures are positively correlated with air temperature.\")\n",
        "print(\"- **Soil Moisture:** The correlations involving soil moisture vary, suggesting that its relationship with other parameters might be more complex and influenced by factors like precipitation, irrigation, and soil type.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\n### 4. Implications of Vapor Pressure Deficit (VPD)\")\n",
        "print(\"VPD is a crucial indicator of plant water stress. Analyzing the VPD for the weather station data provides valuable insights:\")\n",
        "print(\"\\n#### Diurnal VPD Pattern:\")\n",
        "plt.figure(figsize=(12, 6))\n",
        "sns.lineplot(data=df_tamale, x=df_tamale.index.hour, y='Weather_Station_VPD_kPa', label='Tamale')\n",
        "sns.lineplot(data=df_kumasi, x=df_kumasi.index.hour, y='Weather_Station_VPD_kPa', label='Kumasi')\n",
        "plt.title('Diurnal Pattern of Weather Station VPD')\n",
        "plt.xlabel('Hour of the Day')\n",
        "plt.ylabel('Weather Station VPD (kPa)')\n",
        "plt.xticks(range(0, 24))\n",
        "plt.grid(True)\n",
        "plt.legend()\n",
